(6067303, 893053, 28564, '<td valign="top">hi...<br/> <br/>as photographer i have to give you a very low score, i think that is the correct way to try to improve you skill, obviously i want to explain to you why...<br/> <br/>yes, the river is tilted, but there is nothing in the right place, no correct focus on a subject (water, plants, rocks), the whites of the water are in 255 (no details in it)... so, i give you a 2...<br/> <br/>i hope not to have made it nasty and not having created an enemy!<br/> <br/>and sorry for my bad english!</td>', 'hi... as photographer i have to give you a very low score, i think that is the correct way to try to improve you skill, obviously i want to explain to you why... yes, the river is tilted, but there is nothing in the right place, no correct focus on a subject (water, plants, rocks), the whites of the water are in 255 (no details in it)... so, i give you a 2... i hope not to have made it nasty and not having created an enemy! and sorry for my bad english!', '2010-06-23 06:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
