(6069145, 892740, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and lines. I feel that tilting this so far doesn''t really add much to the image. Maybe if it were tilted so the main corner of the building went from corner to corner, it would have been more powerful in my eyes.</td>', 'I like the colors and lines. I feel that tilting this so far doesn''t really add much to the image. Maybe if it were tilted so the main corner of the building went from corner to corner, it would have been more powerful in my eyes.', '2010-06-24 21:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069150, 893101, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors in this photo. The tilt here definitely adds to this photo, as it gives the viewer a real sense for the length of the walk.</td>', 'Wonderful colors in this photo. The tilt here definitely adds to this photo, as it gives the viewer a real sense for the length of the walk.', '2010-06-24 21:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069151, 892760, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and depth of field in this shot. But I don''t feel that the tilt adds anything to the photo, it simply feels like tilting for the sake of tilting.</td>', 'I like the colors and depth of field in this shot. But I don''t feel that the tilt adds anything to the photo, it simply feels like tilting for the sake of tilting.', '2010-06-24 21:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069153, 892992, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the excitement of the moment. I think the tilt helps this photo by showing more of the girls and her costume.</td>', 'Great capture of the excitement of the moment. I think the tilt helps this photo by showing more of the girls and her costume.', '2010-06-24 21:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069156, 892954, 114225, '<td valign="top">To me, this photo feels more like an overall mistake than anything. The main subject isn''t the focus point, and the tilt feels more like not paying attention to the horizon. Sorry!</td>', 'To me, this photo feels more like an overall mistake than anything. The main subject isn''t the focus point, and the tilt feels more like not paying attention to the horizon. Sorry!', '2010-06-24 21:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069158, 893109, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very similar to one of the shots I originally took for this challenge. A lot of cool colors in the sky. Not sure the tilt adds a lot to this photo, but it does add something.</td>', 'Very similar to one of the shots I originally took for this challenge. A lot of cool colors in the sky. Not sure the tilt adds a lot to this photo, but it does add something.', '2010-06-24 21:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069159, 892902, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette. Tilt in this is used well.</td>', 'Great silhouette. Tilt in this is used well.', '2010-06-24 21:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069162, 892523, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Is it a parachute? Doesn''t feel like the tilt is working for me here.</td>', 'Interesting photo. Is it a parachute? Doesn''t feel like the tilt is working for me here.', '2010-06-24 21:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069165, 892987, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of tilt to get the entire building in frame.</td>', 'Great use of tilt to get the entire building in frame.', '2010-06-24 21:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069166, 892391, 114225, '<td valign="top">My first reaction to this was "the tilt looks like a mistake" so you may see some low votes come in from the knee jerk voters. I do like how the tilt gives a sense of action.</td>', 'My first reaction to this was "the tilt looks like a mistake" so you may see some low votes come in from the knee jerk voters. I do like how the tilt gives a sense of action.', '2010-06-24 21:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069167, 893044, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great colors. I like how you positioned the sun behind the tree to get the reflection without blowing out the sky.</td>', 'Great colors. I like how you positioned the sun behind the tree to get the reflection without blowing out the sky.', '2010-06-24 21:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069168, 892375, 59633, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus...</td>', 'A bit out of focus...', '2010-06-24 21:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069169, 893038, 114225, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a really cool photo in landscape mode, and maybe slightly tilted to help show action. In portrait mode, it just doesn''t feel right.</td>', 'I think this could have been a really cool photo in landscape mode, and maybe slightly tilted to help show action. In portrait mode, it just doesn''t feel right.', '2010-06-24 21:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069171, 892837, 114225, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, there is a lo of noise in this photo. Seems like this building should have some really cool reflections, but the noise is preventing it.</td>', 'Unfortunately, there is a lo of noise in this photo. Seems like this building should have some really cool reflections, but the noise is preventing it.', '2010-06-24 21:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069172, 892482, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the use of tilt here. Gives the viewer more of a perception of what the area looks like.</td>', 'I like the use of tilt here. Gives the viewer more of a perception of what the area looks like.', '2010-06-24 21:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069173, 892424, 114225, '<td valign="top">The tilt is used to perfection here. The eyes start in the lower right corner, and naturally move into the photo.</td>', 'The tilt is used to perfection here. The eyes start in the lower right corner, and naturally move into the photo.', '2010-06-24 21:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069174, 892979, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Not only is the cabin very quirky, but the tilt adds to that quirkiness.</td>', 'Great shot. Not only is the cabin very quirky, but the tilt adds to that quirkiness.', '2010-06-24 21:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069175, 892525, 114225, '<td valign="top">The tilt here gives a much better feeling of movement to this photo.</td>', 'The tilt here gives a much better feeling of movement to this photo.', '2010-06-24 21:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069210, 893033, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice tilt and excellent B&amp;W.</td>', 'Nice tilt and excellent B&W.', '2010-06-24 22:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069211, 892977, 23484, '<td valign="top">I remember when that thing drove me nuts.</td>', 'I remember when that thing drove me nuts.', '2010-06-24 22:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6069212, 892345, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and excellent capture.</td>', 'Nice angle and excellent capture.', '2010-06-24 22:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
