(6069510, 893053, 117474, '<td valign="top">It''s a little out of focus, I think. Is it? <br/>While the long exposure does add a sense of motion to the waterfall, I think in most cases you need a clear reference of stillness to admire the motion. I don''t think this is one of the those cases I''m afraid. <br/>I like the subtle use of tilt in this. I think it''s a lot better than was there a significant amount more.</td>', 'It''s a little out of focus, I think. Is it? While the long exposure does add a sense of motion to the waterfall, I think in most cases you need a clear reference of stillness to admire the motion. I don''t think this is one of the those cases I''m afraid. I like the subtle use of tilt in this. I think it''s a lot better than was there a significant amount more.', '2010-06-25 07:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
