(6073071, 892954, 103142, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m not anti-blur, but I don''t think it helps this shot. If it were sharp, I would have liked it very much. Nice tilt, good subject, blur doesn''t work, imo.</td>', 'Sorry, I''m not anti-blur, but I don''t think it helps this shot. If it were sharp, I would have liked it very much. Nice tilt, good subject, blur doesn''t work, imo.', '2010-06-29 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6073074, 892512, 103142, '<td valign="top">This could have been a much better shot (imo) if you had recomposed to get more of the girl and less of the foreground bread because of the small depth of field. Your tilt is actually quite effective, but unfortunately, the oof bread really draws your eye away from the more interesting aspects of the shot.</td>', 'This could have been a much better shot (imo) if you had recomposed to get more of the girl and less of the foreground bread because of the small depth of field. Your tilt is actually quite effective, but unfortunately, the oof bread really draws your eye away from the more interesting aspects of the shot.', '2010-06-29 12:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6073143, 892837, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lots of grainy noise visible in all the windows. Achieving that smooth even look with modern glass buildings can be tough to do at times. A touch of noise reduction could help this a lot, though.</td>', 'Lots of grainy noise visible in all the windows. Achieving that smooth even look with modern glass buildings can be tough to do at times. A touch of noise reduction could help this a lot, though.', '2010-06-29 13:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6073149, 893113, 83313, '<td valign="top">As much as this tries to come off to me with impact, it''s falling a little short to me somehow, and I can''t quite nail down why. I do know I have past entries of my own that have performed poorly for the same reasons. Perhaps the flare does not work, or maybe if you''d clipped the shadows some, to make it more of a sihlouette. Not really sure.</td>', 'As much as this tries to come off to me with impact, it''s falling a little short to me somehow, and I can''t quite nail down why. I do know I have past entries of my own that have performed poorly for the same reasons. Perhaps the flare does not work, or maybe if you''d clipped the shadows some, to make it more of a sihlouette. Not really sure.', '2010-06-29 13:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6073151, 892979, 83313, '<td valign="top">Might as well use a good subject again, right? Works well for this challenge.</td>', 'Might as well use a good subject again, right? Works well for this challenge.', '2010-06-29 13:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6073156, 892000, 83313, '<td valign="top">Those big old italian sausage sandwiches look pretty darn good. Your tilt is clearly that of your own perspective on the scene. I''ll be curious to read the other comments after voting to see if everyone got that take on it or not.</td>', 'Those big old italian sausage sandwiches look pretty darn good. Your tilt is clearly that of your own perspective on the scene. I''ll be curious to read the other comments after voting to see if everyone got that take on it or not.', '2010-06-29 14:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6073158, 892399, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, though it appears to be shot in harsh midday sun, which is rarely a flattering light.</td>', 'Nice subject, though it appears to be shot in harsh midday sun, which is rarely a flattering light.', '2010-06-29 14:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6073159, 892563, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not an awful lot of tilt to this. Seems just enough to make it fit the topic. Or, is the tilt meant to be the angle of the car when it is being towed off?</td>', 'Not an awful lot of tilt to this. Seems just enough to make it fit the topic. Or, is the tilt meant to be the angle of the car when it is being towed off?', '2010-06-29 14:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6073161, 893016, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off as very yellowish, soft and noisy. Perhaps a different white balance would have given it better appeal for me.</td>', 'Comes off as very yellowish, soft and noisy. Perhaps a different white balance would have given it better appeal for me.', '2010-06-29 14:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6073164, 893038, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice take on it. I had to look for a few moments to realize what this was and that it was 90 degrees rotated.</td>', 'Nice take on it. I had to look for a few moments to realize what this was and that it was 90 degrees rotated.', '2010-06-29 14:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
