(6078195, 892284, 66384, '<td valign="top">The alley is very interesting and quite exciting. The tilt adds to that effect. But what I find the most interesting is the woman entering the alley. I wonder if this would have scored better if you had caller it "The Alley". The title should''t matter, but it would have given the image a different emphasis. Btw, I like it.</td>', 'The alley is very interesting and quite exciting. The tilt adds to that effect. But what I find the most interesting is the woman entering the alley. I wonder if this would have scored better if you had caller it "The Alley". The title should''t matter, but it would have given the image a different emphasis. Btw, I like it.', '2010-07-03 01:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
